# Licence notes for this skill pack

## This repository (skill documentation)
The skill markdown in `skills/` is provided so other agents can reuse the same
workflow. Unless a file says otherwise, you may copy and adapt these skill docs
for your own agent setup.

These docs describe a pipeline; they do **not** grant any licence to the
onetake software or to third-party media (photos, music, SFX).

## Upstream: onetake (PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0)
The motion engine used by these skills is:

  https://github.com/feitangyuan/onetake

Required Notice (from upstream):  
Copyright (c) 2026 Patrick. onetake is free for noncommercial use only.

Full terms: https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0  
Also see the `LICENSE` file inside the onetake repository.

**Do not use onetake (including rendering films with it) for commercial /
monetised work** unless you have a separate commercial licence from the
licensor. For commercial projects, reuse only the editorial method from these
skills and produce the film in another tool (After Effects, DaVinci Resolve,
Unreal Sequencer, etc.).

## Third-party assets
When following the skills, credit and comply with each asset's own licence
(Wikimedia, Flickr CC, Kevin MacLeod / CC BY, Kenney CC0, University of Iowa
MIS samples, Voxengo IR, Noto fonts / OFL, etc.). Keep a CREDITS file in each
film project.
